From f782f46c3c700e867fa108b745018538916809ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:54:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fixup! consensus(v2): connect native state, monetary and
 script rules

Restore the inherited miner fixture to actual legacy scripts and inputs, matching its explicit version2 coinbases and transaction defaults. Keep empty legacy funding scripts spent by OP_TRUE scriptSig and the original real P2SH negative redeem-script case; retain explicit native coinbase/overlay controls elsewhere.

Both CreateNewBlock validity cases, without and with preconsensus, pass with unchanged size/orphan/double-spend/P2SH/locktime/package/priority assertions. Before they threw legacy transaction with V2 input; a draft OP_TRUE/OP_TRUE setup correctly failed CleanStack and was corrected to the original inherited empty-script funding oracle. No consensus or rejection assertion was relaxed.

Tier: V2
---
 src/test/miner_tests.cpp | 57 ++++++++++++++++------------------------
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+), 35 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/test/miner_tests.cpp b/src/test/miner_tests.cpp
index edc649aedd..99c4384882 100644
--- a/src/test/miner_tests.cpp
+++ b/src/test/miner_tests.cpp
@@ -146,22 +146,6 @@ static CBlockIndex CreateBlockIndex(int nHeight, CBlockIndex *active_chain_tip)
     return index;
